  "body": "We use this in fetch to handle termination. The pattern is:\r\n\r\n1. Run these substeps, but abort the substeps if *condition*:\r\n    1. Do stuff\r\n    1. Do more stuff\r\n    1. Do another thing\r\n\r\nIs this an acceptable use of substeps? Alternatively we could allow \"break\" in this pattern:\r\n\r\n1. Run these substeps, and break if *condition*:\r\n    1. Do stuff\r\n    1. Do more stuff\r\n    1. Do another thing",
